<% --[[ The compact band every working page opens with. Deliberately not a hero: Home earns a full one
        because it is a landing page, but Library, Tools and Downloads are places you go to do
        something, and an image tall enough to be worth having pushes the list below the fold on
        every single visit.

        `image` is optional and comes from page.config.images, either as a plain URL or as
        { src, flip }. Without one the band is a gradient and still reads as a header; with one it is
        covered, centred and darkened, so nothing depends on the picture having a particular size.
        `flip` mirrors it, for artwork whose subject sits on the side the title needs. ]] %>
<% local img = image %>
<div class="phead<%= img and " hasimg" or "" %><%= img and img.flip and " flip" or "" %>"<%
     if img then %> style="--phead-img:url('<%= img.src %>')"<% end %>>
  <div class="pt">
    <h1><%= title %></h1>
    <% if lead then %><p><%= lead %></p><% end %>
  </div>
  <% if aside then %><div class="pa"><%- aside %></div><% end %>
</div>
